# CWC documentation map

| Need | Open |
|------|------|
| Project / team / IRB / survey aggregates / agent ethics | `AGENTS.md` or `CWC_Health_App/00_PROJECT_RUNDOWN_CWC_Health_App.md` |
| Requirement IDs (NAV-*, FIND-*, MYH-*, …) | `CWC_Health_App/01_CWC_Health_App_Feature_Specification_v0.4.md` |
| Tokens, screen↔spec table, presentation notes | `CWC_Health_App/02_CWC_Health_App_Design_Reference_v1.1.md` |
| Pixels / lo-fi co-design / hi-fi | Figma https://www.figma.com/design/yAwsNNegakKROue3o0CAMJ |
| Spec history only | `CWC_Health_App/archive/` (v0.1–v0.3) — **not** authoritative |
| October 2026 study build status | `docs/engineering/starting-release.md` |
| Nearby live-data engineering (implemented, including FIND-4 map) | `docs/engineering/nearby-live-data.md` → `docs/superpowers/specs/` + `docs/superpowers/plans/` |
| Flutter CI (format / analyze / test / Android APK) | `.github/workflows/flutter-ci.yml` + `docs/engineering/README.md` |

**Rule of three:** rundown = project; spec = behavior; design ref + Figma = look. Change one → check the other two; bump versions together.

Do not invent clinical/content policy. Vetted Learn sources and Help Now numbers are research-team/CAB-owned; ship via configurable content, not hard-coded assumptions, when possible.
